  "label": "Dehumanizing Metaphor in Racism",
  "description": "This background knowledge refers to the use of dehumanizing metaphors in racist discourse, where groups are compared to animals or objects to justify oppression. In this meme, the ants are used as a dehumanizing metaphor for Black people, implying they are 'slaves' and 'inferior,' which is a form of racial dehumanization.",
